(hasTitle E_paper_sample "A Novel Hybrid Framework for Efficient Graph Pattern Discovery in Heterogeneous Networks")
(hasOverview E_paper_sample "This paper introduces HeteroPatternMine, a novel hybrid framework designed to efficiently discover meaningful and interpretable graph patterns in large, heterogeneous networks. It addresses limitations of traditional and embedding-based graph mining methods, which struggle with scalability, heterogeneity, and interpretability, by integrating topology-aware sampling, semantic-enriched embeddings, and adaptive pattern pruning. The goal is to reduce computational overhead while improving pattern quality and diversity.")
