(hasTitle E_paper_sample "A Novel Hybrid Framework for Efficient Graph Pattern Discovery in Heterogeneous Networks")
(hasOverview E_paper_sample "This paper proposes HeteroPatternMine, a novel hybrid framework that integrates topology-aware sampling, semantic-enriched embeddings, and adaptive pattern pruning to efficiently discover meaningful and interpretable graph patterns. The method addresses key limitations in prior graph mining approaches by reducing computational overhead and improving pattern quality and diversity, particularly for complex relational data in heterogeneous networks.")
