(hasOverview E_paper_sample "This paper introduces HeteroPatternMine, a novel hybrid framework for efficient graph pattern discovery in heterogeneous networks. It integrates topology-aware sampling, semantic-enriched embeddings, and adaptive pattern pruning to overcome key limitations of prior approaches in graph mining, such as scalability, handling diverse node/edge types, and capturing both structural and semantic patterns in very large graphs, thereby improving pattern quality and diversity while reducing computational overhead.")
